  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/07ZB">Example <span data-tag="07ZB">15.8.5</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. The Fitting ideals of the finite free module $M = R^{\oplus n}$ are $\text{Fit}_ k(M) = 0$ for $k < n$ and $\text{Fit}_ k(M) = R$ for $k \geq n$. </p>
